#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:2
msgid "DaoAI World 部署和使用指南"
msgstr "DaoAI World Deployment and Usage Guide"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:4
msgid "本指南将帮助您在收到服务器后完成电源和网络连接，并通过查看本机 IP 地址，从局域网设备和本机浏览器中访问 DaoAI World 应用。"
msgstr ""
"This guide will help you complete power and network connections after "
"receiving the server, and access the DaoAI World application from a LAN "
"device and a native browser by viewing the local IP address."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:6
msgid "部署 DaoAI World 服务器需要以下 5 个步骤："
msgstr "Deploying the DaoAI World server requires the following 5 steps:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:8
msgid ":ref:`1. 服务器准备`"
msgstr ":ref:`1. Server preparation`"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:9
msgid ":ref:`2. 开机并登录操作系统`"
msgstr ":ref:`2. Turn on the computer and log in to the operating system`"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:10
msgid ":ref:`3. 查看本机 IP 地址`"
msgstr ":ref:`3. View the IP address of this machine`"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:11
msgid ":ref:`4. 局域网其他设备访问`"
msgstr ":ref:`4. Access from other devices on LAN`"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:12
msgid ":ref:`5. Ubuntu 桌面版本地浏览器访问`"
msgstr ":ref:`5. Browser access to Ubuntu desktop version`"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:15
msgid "1. 服务器准备"
msgstr "1. Server preparation"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:18
msgid "1.1 检查配件"
msgstr "1.1 Check accessories"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:20
msgid "确认收到以下配件： - 服务器主机 - 电源线 - 网线 - 相关说明书"
msgstr ""
"Confirm receipt of the following accessories: - Server host - Power cord - "
"Network cable - Related instructions"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:26
msgid "确保服务器完好无损。"
msgstr "Make sure the server is intact."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:29
msgid "1.2 连接电源和网线"
msgstr "1.2 Connect the power supply and network cable"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:31
msgid "将电源线插入服务器电源接口，并连接到电源插座。"
msgstr ""
"Plug the power cord into the server power connector and connect it to an "
"electrical outlet."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:32
msgid "使用网线将服务器网口连接至局域网交换机或路由器，并检查网口灯是否正常亮起。"
msgstr ""
"Use a network cable to connect the server network port to the LAN switch or "
"router, and check whether the network port light is on normally."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:36
msgid "外观示意图"
msgstr "Appearance diagram"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:42
msgid "图例：服务器外观及电源和网线连接示意图"
msgstr ""
"Legend: Server appearance and schematic diagram of power supply and network "
"cable connection"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:46
msgid "网口灯闪烁表示网络连接正常。"
msgstr ""
"The network port light flashes to indicate that the network connection is "
"normal."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:49
msgid "1.3 其他准备工作"
msgstr "1.3 Other preparations"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:51
msgid "确保局域网内的路由器或交换机已正常运行。"
msgstr ""
"Make sure the router or switch within the LAN is functioning properly."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:52
msgid "如果需要远程管理，请记录服务器的序列号联系北京微链技术支持人员。"
msgstr ""
"If remote management is required, please record the server's serial number "
"and contact Beijing Welink technical support personnel."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:64
msgid "2. 开机并登录操作系统"
msgstr "2. Turn on the computer and log in to the operating system"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:67
msgid "2.1 开机"
msgstr "2.1 Power on"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:69
msgid "按下服务器电源按钮，启动服务器。"
msgstr "Press the server power button to start the server."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:72
msgid "2.2 登录 Ubuntu 桌面"
msgstr "2.2 Log in to Ubuntu desktop"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:74
msgid "如果服务器连接显示器和键盘：输入管理员账户信息登录 Ubuntu 桌面。 默认用户名：dwuser 默认用户密码：dwuser"
msgstr ""
"If the server is connected to a monitor and keyboard: Enter the "
"administrator account information to log in to the Ubuntu desktop.Default "
"username: dwuser Default user password: dwuser"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:78
msgid "如果未连接显示器，可通过 SSH 访问服务器（需提前了解到服务器在局域网中的 IP 地址）。"
msgstr ""
"If the monitor is not connected, you can access the server through SSH (you "
"need to know the server's IP address in the LAN in advance)."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:80
msgid "Ubuntu登录界面示意图"
msgstr "Ubuntu login interface diagram"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:86
msgid "图例：Ubuntu 登录界面示意图"
msgstr "Legend: Ubuntu login interface diagram"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:89
msgid "3. 查看本机 IP 地址"
msgstr "3. View the IP address of this machine"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:92
msgid "3.1 方法一：通过 Ubuntu 命令行终端查看"
msgstr "3.1 Method 1: View through Ubuntu command line terminal"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:94
msgid "按 Ctrl + Alt + T 打开终端。"
msgstr "Press Ctrl + Alt + T to open the terminal."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:95
msgid "输入以下命令：ifconfig"
msgstr "Enter the following command: ifconfig"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:96
msgid "在输出结果中找到名称为 eno1 的网卡 IP 地址，例如：inet 192.168.10.61/24"
msgstr ""
"Find the IP address of the network card named eno1 in the output, for "
"example: inet 192.168.10.61/24"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:97
msgid "eno1 网卡的 IP 地址即为服务器的 IP 地址，我们将在下一步访问 DaoAI World。"
msgstr ""
"The IP address of the eno1 network card is the IP address of the server. We "
"will visit DaoAI World in the next step."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:100
msgid "3.2 方法二：通过局域网路由器查看"
msgstr "3.2 Method 2: View through LAN router"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:102
msgid "登录局域网路由器管理界面，查看设备列表以获取服务器的 IP 地址。"
msgstr ""
"Log in to the LAN router management interface and view the device list to "
"obtain the server's IP address."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:103
msgid "登录路由器管理页面，例如在浏览器中输入 192.168.1.1 进入管理页面。"
msgstr ""
"Log in to the router management page, for example, enter 192.168.1.1 in the "
"browser to enter the management page."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:104
msgid "在 DHCP 列表中，找到设备名为 welinkirt 的设备，查看其 IP 地址。"
msgstr ""
"In the DHCP list, find the device with the device name welinkirt and view "
"its IP address."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:106
msgid "路由器管理页面"
msgstr "Router management page"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:112
msgid "图例：路由器管理页面"
msgstr "Legend: Router management page"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:116
msgid "4. 局域网其他设备访问"
msgstr "4. Access from other devices on LAN"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:119
msgid "4.1 确保其他设备连接同一局域网"
msgstr "4.1 Make sure other devices are connected to the same LAN"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:121
msgid "确保您的电脑、手机等设备与 DaoAI World 服务器处于同一局域网中。"
msgstr ""
"Make sure your computer, mobile phone and other devices are in the same "
"local area network as the DaoAI World server."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:124
msgid "4.2 通过浏览器访问 DaoAI World 和 DaoAI 天眼平台"
msgstr "4.2 Access DaoAI World and DaoAI Tianyan platform through the browser"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:126
msgid "在局域网设备的浏览器中输入服务器 IP 地址，例如："
msgstr ""
"Enter the server IP address into the browser of your LAN device, for "
"example:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:127
msgid "DaoAI World http://192.168.10.61。"
msgstr "DaoAI World http://192.168.10.61。"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:128
msgid "DaoAI 天眼平台 http://192.168.10.61:38080/dashboard。"
msgstr "DaoAI Tianyan platform http://192.168.10.61:38080/dashboard."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:129
msgid "如果成功，您将看到 DaoAI World 登录页面 或者DaoAI 天眼平台主界面。"
msgstr ""
"If successful, you will see the DaoAI World login page or the DaoAI Tianyan "
"platform main interface."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:140
msgid "4.3 登录并使用 DaoAI World"
msgstr "4.3 Log in and use DaoAI World"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:142
msgid "可以使用默认的 DaoAI World 账户进行登录管理："
msgstr "You can use the default DaoAI World account for login management:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:143
msgid "默认用户名：dwuser"
msgstr "Default username: dwuser"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:144
msgid "默认用户密码：dwuser123"
msgstr "Default user password: dwuser123"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:146
msgid "登录后，您可以进行训练流程、数据管理、模型管理等操作。"
msgstr ""
"After logging in, you can perform operations such as training process, data "
"management, and model management."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:150
msgid "5. Ubuntu 桌面版本地浏览器访问"
msgstr "5. Browser access to Ubuntu desktop version"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:153
msgid "5.1 打开浏览器"
msgstr "5.1 Open the browser"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:155
msgid "在 Ubuntu 桌面，点击左下角的应用菜单，找到并打开浏览器（例如 Chrome）。"
msgstr ""
"On the Ubuntu desktop, click the application menu in the lower left corner, "
"find and open the browser (such as Chrome)."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:158
msgid "5.2 输入服务器地址"
msgstr "5.2 Enter the server address"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:160
msgid "在浏览器地址栏输入：127.0.0.1 您将看到 DaoAI World 登录页面。"
msgstr ""
"Enter: 127.0.0.1 in the browser address bar and you will see the DaoAI World"
" login page."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:165
msgid "6. 常见问题"
msgstr "6. FAQ"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:168
msgid "6.1 正常显示登录页面，但无法成功登录"
msgstr ""
"6.1 The login page is displayed normally, but login cannot be successful."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:170
msgid "如果登录无响应，请按以下操作进入排查流程："
msgstr ""
"If there is no response when logging in, please follow the steps below to "
"enter the troubleshooting process:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:172
msgid "**在浏览器页面点击 F12，打开开发者工具**"
msgstr "**Click F12 on the browser page to open the developer tools**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:174
msgid "浏览器开发者工具截图"
msgstr "Browser developer tools screenshot"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:180
msgid "图例：按 F12 打开开发者工具。"
msgstr "Legend: Press F12 to open developer tools."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:182
msgid "**打开网络（Network）标签，查看名称为 Login 的请求**"
msgstr "**Open the Network tab and view the request named Login**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:184
msgid "登录请求失败截图"
msgstr "Screenshot of failed login request"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:190
msgid "图例：以上为 Network 标签中 Login 请求的信息。"
msgstr ""
"Legend: The above is the information requested by Login in the Network tab."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:192
msgid "**查看名称为 (Login) 的标签，并判断请求 IP 地址是否正确**"
msgstr ""
"**View the label named (Login) and determine whether the requested IP "
"address is correct**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:194
msgid "登录信息截图"
msgstr "Screenshot of login information"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:200
msgid "图例：以上为 Network 标签中 Login 请求的详细信息，其中请求 URL 理应为您的浏览器访问地址。"
msgstr ""
"Legend: The above is the details of the Login request in the Network tab, "
"where the request URL should be your browser access address."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:202
msgid ""
"**注：** - 请确保 login 请求的 URL 和您当前浏览器访问的 **局域网地址** 保持一致。 - 如果显示为 "
"172.xxx.xxx.xxx 这样的 **IP 地址**，这可能是由于以下原因："
msgstr ""
"**Note:** - Please ensure that the URL requested by login is consistent with"
" the **LAN address** currently accessed by your browser.- If an **IP "
"address** appears as 172.xxx.xxx.xxx, this may be due to the following "
"reasons:"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:205
msgid "**网络问题**：设备未和 DW 服务器处于同一局域网中。"
msgstr ""
"**Network Issue**: The device is not on the same LAN as the DW server."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:206
msgid "**服务器未启动**：请检查服务器电源是否正常开启。"
msgstr ""
"**Server not started**: Please check whether the server power is turned on "
"normally."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:207
msgid "**服务未开启**：DW 平台的后端服务地址未成功启动，请联系技术支持团队排查。"
msgstr ""
"**Service not started**: The back-end service address of the DW platform has"
" not been successfully started. Please contact the technical support team "
"for troubleshooting."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:209
msgid ""
"**解决办法：** - 请尝试重启 DW 离线版服务器，后端地址会自动更新。 - 请在 F12 页面，网络（Network）标签中选择 "
"\"禁用缓存\"，并刷新页面，稍后再次尝试登录。 - 请再次检查网络连接是否正常，如有问题，请联系技术支持团队排查。"
msgstr ""
"**Solution:** - Please try to restart the DW offline version server, the "
"backend address will be updated automatically.- Please select \"Disable "
"Cache\" on the F12 page, Network tab, refresh the page, and try logging in "
"again later.- Please check again whether the network connection is normal. "
"If there is any problem, please contact the technical support team for "
"troubleshooting."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:216
msgid "6.2 我该如何固定我的服务器地址？"
msgstr "6.2 How do I fix my server address?"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:218
msgid "如果您有固定服务器 IP 的需求以便于长期使用，请按照以下操作在路由器中设置静态 IP 地址。"
msgstr ""
"If you have a need for a fixed server IP for long-term use, please follow "
"the steps below to set a static IP address in your router."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:220
msgid "**登录路由器管理界面**"
msgstr "**Log in to the router management interface**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:222
msgid ""
"打开浏览器，在地址栏输入路由器的管理 IP 地址（例如 192.168.1.1、192.168.0.1 或者其他根据您的路由器设置的 IP 地址）。 "
"输入管理员账号和密码（通常在路由器的背面贴纸上，或者您设置时配置的用户名和密码）。"
msgstr ""
"Open your browser and enter your router's management IP address in the "
"address bar (for example, 192.168.1.1, 192.168.0.1, or another IP address "
"based on your router's settings). Enter your administrator account and "
"password (usually on a sticker on the back of the router, or the username "
"and password you configured during setup)."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:225
msgid "**找到 DHCP 设置部分**"
msgstr "**Find the DHCP settings section**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:227
msgid ""
"登录后，进入路由器的管理界面。 寻找 **网络设置**、**LAN 设置** 或者 **DHCP 设置** 等选项。具体位置可能不同，通常会在 "
"**高级设置** 或 **局域网（LAN）设置** 中找到 DHCP 配置选项。"
msgstr ""
"After logging in, enter the router’s management interface.Look for options "
"like **Network Settings**, **LAN Settings**, or **DHCP Settings**.The exact "
"location may vary, typically DHCP configuration options will be found in "
"**Advanced Settings** or **Local Area Network (LAN) Settings**."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:230
msgid "**启用静态 IP 分配（DHCP 静态租赁）**"
msgstr "**Enable Static IP Assignment (DHCP Static Lease)**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:232
msgid ""
"在 DHCP 设置页面，找到一个叫做 **DHCP 静态租赁**、**静态 IP 分配** 或类似名称的选项。 - 点击 **添加静态租赁** 或 "
"**添加 DHCP 保留** 按钮。 - 输入您希望为设备分配的 **静态 IP 地址**，例如 192.168.1.100。 - 在 **设备 MAC"
" 地址** 框中，输入您要为其分配静态 IP 地址的 **MAC 地址**。 - 在有些路由器中，您可以通过选择已连接设备列表中的设备来自动填入其 "
"MAC 地址。"
msgstr ""
"On the DHCP Settings page, find an option called **DHCP Static Lease**, "
"**Static IP Assignment**, or something similar.- Click the **Add Static "
"Lease** or **Add DHCP Reservation** button.- Enter the **static IP address**"
" you wish to assign to the device, for example 192.168.1.100.- In the "
"**Device MAC Address** box, enter the **MAC address** to which you want to "
"assign a static IP address.- In some routers, you can automatically fill in "
"the MAC address of a device by selecting it in the list of connected "
"devices."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:238
msgid "**保存并应用设置**"
msgstr "**Save and apply settings**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:240
msgid "完成静态 IP 分配后，保存设置并使其生效。 路由器可能会要求重启或者自动应用更改。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the static IP assignment, save the settings and make them "
"effective.The router may ask for a reboot or apply the changes "
"automatically."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:243
msgid "**验证静态 IP 是否生效**"
msgstr "**Verify whether the static IP is valid**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:245
msgid "重启设备（例如计算机、手机等），或者断开并重新连接到网络。"
msgstr ""
"Restart your device (e.g. computer, phone, etc.) or disconnect and reconnect"
" to the network."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:246
msgid "在设备上检查其 IP 地址，应该能够看到您分配的静态 IP 地址。"
msgstr ""
"Check its IP address on the device and you should be able to see the static "
"IP address you assigned."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:248
msgid "**示例步骤（以 TP-Link 路由器为例）**"
msgstr "**Example steps (taking TP-Link router as an example)**"

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:250
msgid "登录到路由器管理页面（通常是 http://192.168.0.1 或 http://tplinkwifi.net）。"
msgstr ""
"Log in to the router management page (usually http://192.168.0.1 or "
"http://tplinkwifi.net)."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:251
msgid "输入用户名和密码（默认为 admin/admin，除非您更改过）。"
msgstr ""
"Enter your username and password (default is admin/admin unless you have "
"changed it)."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:252
msgid "点击 **DHCP** 或 **网络设置**。"
msgstr "Click **DHCP** or **Network Settings**."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:253
msgid "找到 **地址预留** 或 **静态 DHCP**。"
msgstr "Find **Address Reservation** or **Static DHCP**."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:254
msgid "输入设备的 **MAC 地址** 和您希望分配的 **IP 地址**。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the device's **MAC address** and the **IP address** you wish to "
"assign."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:255
msgid "保存设置并重启设备。"
msgstr "Save the settings and restart the device."

#: ../../source/quick_start/offline_setup.rst:257
msgid ""
"**注意事项** - **MAC 地址唯一性**：确保为每个设备设置一个唯一的 IP 地址，以避免冲突。 - **IP 地址范围**：确保您分配的静态 "
"IP 地址位于路由器的 DHCP 范围内，但不要与路由器自动分配的其他 IP 地址重叠。"
msgstr ""
"**Note** - **MAC Address Uniqueness**: Make sure to set a unique IP address "
"for each device to avoid conflicts.- **IP Address Range**: Make sure the "
"static IP address you assign is within the router's DHCP range, but does not"
" overlap with other IP addresses automatically assigned by the router."

